00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:01.363
keep the motivation, keep the faith.

00:18:03.194 --> 00:18:05.350
At the end of the day,

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.580
at least in my 21 years of experience,

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:10.010
